module.exports = JSON.parse('{"cars":[{"category":"SUV","availability":true,"brand":"Toyota","model":"Yaris-Cross","model_year":2022,"mileage":15000,"fuel_type":"Hybrid","seats":5,"price_per_day":100,"quantity":3,"power":"Power","id":"1","location":"Japan","description":"The Toyota Yaris Cross is a compact SUV (Sport Utility Vehicle) manufactured by Toyota, a renowned Japanese automaker. It is based on the popular Toyota Yaris hatchback but designed with SUV characteristics to offer a more rugged and versatile driving experience."},{"category":"Minivan","availability":true,"brand":"Kia","model":"Carnival","model_year":2023,"mileage":5000,"fuel_type":"Petrol","seats":8,"price_per_day":180,"quantity":3,"power":"Diesel","id":"2","location":"South Korean","description":"The Kia Carnival is a spacious and versatile minivan that offers comfortable seating for up to 8 passengers. It is designed to prove a smooth and enjoyable driving experience for both the driver and the passengers. The Carnival comes with a host of advanced features and modern technologies, making it an excellent choice for family trips and group outings."},{"category":"Wagon","availability":false,"brand":"Toyota","model":"Auris","model_year":2018,"mileage":15000,"fuel_type":"Diesel","seats":5,"price_per_day":150,"quantity":2,"power":"Basic","id":"3","location":"Japan","description":"The Toyota Auris is a compact hatchback car model produced by the Japanese automaker Toyota. It is known for its stylish design, reliable performance, and fuel efficiency. The Auris offers a comfortable and spacious interior, making it suitable for both daily commuting and longer trips."},{"category":"SUV","availability":true,"brand":"Hyundai","model":"Tucson","model_year":2020,"mileage":5000,"fuel_type":"Petrol","seats":4,"price_per_day":180,"quantity":2,"power":"Basic","id":"4","location":"South Korean","description":"The Hyundai Tucson is a compact SUV produced by the South Korean automaker Hyundai. It was first introduced in 2004 and has since become one of Hyundai\'s popular models in the SUV segment. The Tucson offers a combination of stylish design, comfortable interior, and versatile functionality."},{"category":"SUV","availability":true,"brand":"Toyota","model":"RAV4","model_year":2017,"mileage":13000,"fuel_type":"Diesel","seats":4,"price_per_day":160,"quantity":2,"power":"Basic","id":"5","location":"Japan","description":"The Toyota RAV4 is a compact SUV (Sport Utility Vehicle) that is known for its reliability, versatility, and practicality. It is one of Toyota\'s most popular and successful models, offering a blend of comfort, performance, and utility."},{"category":"Wagon","availability":true,"brand":"Subaru","model":"Outback","model_year":2019,"mileage":8000,"fuel_type":"Diesel","seats":5,"price_per_day":200,"quantity":2,"power":"Power","id":"6","location":"German","description":"The Subaru Outback is a popular crossover SUV that combines the ruggedness of an off-road vehicle with the versatility of a station wagon. It is known for its exceptional handling and off-road capabilities, making it a reliable choice for adventurous individuals and families."},{"category":"SUV","availability":false,"brand":"Ford","model":"Explorer","model_year":2017,"mileage":22000,"fuel_type":"Gasoline","seats":7,"price_per_day":150,"quantity":2,"power":"Power","id":"7","location":"United States","description":"The Ford Explorer is a mid-size SUV (Sports Utility Vehicle) that has been in production since 1990. It is one of the most popular SUV models in the United States. The Explorer is known for its spacious interior, comfortable seating, and versatile cargo capacity, making it a practical choice for families and individuals with active lifestyles."},{"category":"Sedan","availability":true,"brand":"Audi","model":"A6","model_year":2019,"mileage":13000,"fuel_type":"Gasoline","seats":5,"price_per_day":200,"quantity":2,"power":"Basic","id":"8","location":"German","description":"The Audi A6 is a luxury sedan produced by the German automobile manufacturer Audi. It is known for its sleek design, advanced technology, and high-quality craftsmanship. The A6 is positioned between the smaller A4 and the larger A8 in Audi\'s lineup."},{"category":"Sedan","availability":true,"brand":"BMW","model":"740i","model_year":2016,"mileage":18000,"fuel_type":"Gasoline","seats":5,"price_per_day":300,"quantity":2,"power":"Power","id":"9","location":"German","description":"The BMW 740i is a luxury sedan from the renowned German automaker BMW. It is part of the BMW 7 Series, which represents the pinnacle of elegance, comfort, and performance in the BMW lineup. The 740i is known for its exceptional craftsmanship, cutting-edge technology, and powerful performance."},{"category":"Hatchback","availability":false,"brand":"Volkswagen","model":"Golf GTI","model_year":2020,"mileage":8000,"fuel_type":"Gasoline","seats":5,"price_per_day":120,"quantity":2,"power":"Power","id":"10","location":"German","description":"The Volkswagen Golf GTI is a high-performance variant of the popular Volkswagen Golf compact car. Known for its sporty and dynamic driving experience, the Golf GTI has gained a strong reputation among enthusiasts and car lovers."},{"category":"SUV","availability":true,"brand":"Mercedes-Benz","model":"GLE","model_year":2022,"mileage":25000,"fuel_type":"Diesel","seats":7,"price_per_day":250,"quantity":2,"power":"Power","id":"11","location":"United States","description":"The Mercedes-Benz GLE is a luxury midsize SUV that offers a combination of elegance, performance, and advanced technology. It is part of the prestigious Mercedes-Benz lineup and embodies the brand\'s commitment to craftsmanship and innovation."},{"category":"SUV","availability":false,"brand":"Jeep","model":"Grand Cherokee","model_year":2018,"mileage":12000,"fuel_type":"Gasoline","seats":5,"price_per_day":200,"quantity":2,"power":"Power","id":"12","location":"United States","description":"The Jeep Grand Cherokee is a mid-size SUV that has gained popularity for its ruggedness, versatility, and off-road capabilities. It is produced by the American automaker Jeep, a division of Stellantis. The Grand Cherokee has been in production since 1993 and has gone through several generations, with each iteration bringing improvements and updates."},{"category":"UTE","availability":true,"brand":"Toyota","model":"Hilux","model_year":2019,"mileage":15000,"fuel_type":"Diesel","seats":5,"price_per_day":150,"quantity":2,"power":"Power","id":"13","location":"Japan","description":"The Toyota Hilux is a popular pickup truck that has gained a reputation for its durability, reliability, and off-road capability. It is manufactured by Toyota, a renowned Japanese automaker. The Hilux is known for its robust construction, making it suitable for various demanding conditions and terrains."},{"category":"SUV","availability":true,"brand":"BMW","model":"X5","model_year":2019,"mileage":13000,"fuel_type":"Gasoline","seats":5,"price_per_day":300,"quantity":2,"power":"Power","id":"14","location":"German","description":"The BMW X5 is a luxury midsize SUV that offers a blend of elegance, performance, and versatility. As one of BMW\'s flagship SUVs, the X5 combines a sleek and stylish design with advanced technology and a comfortable interior."}]}');

